+| `panels.py` | `auth` | Imports role dependencies at `sepet/api/panels.py:6`; uses them at `sepet/api/panels.py:69`, `sepet/api/panels.py:87`, `sepet/api/panels.py:107`, `sepet/api/panels.py:118`, `sepet/api/panels.py:129`, `sepet/api/panels.py:149`, `sepet/api/panels.py:164`, `sepet/api/panels.py:191`, `sepet/api/panels.py:208`, `sepet/api/panels.py:227`, `sepet/api/panels.py:248`. |
+| `panels.py` | `db` | Imports `get_db` at `sepet/api/panels.py:7`; opens direct database transactions at `sepet/api/panels.py:70`, `sepet/api/panels.py:101`, `sepet/api/panels.py:109`, `sepet/api/panels.py:120`, `sepet/api/panels.py:133`, `sepet/api/panels.py:151`, `sepet/api/panels.py:168`, `sepet/api/panels.py:193`, `sepet/api/panels.py:211`, `sepet/api/panels.py:229`, `sepet/api/panels.py:250`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `auth` | Imports dependencies at `sepet/api/reviews.py:5`; uses `require_customer` at `sepet/api/reviews.py:22`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `db` | Imports helpers at `sepet/api/reviews.py:6`; opens a transaction at `sepet/api/reviews.py:26`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `panels` | Imports `ReviewInput` from the panels module at `sepet/api/reviews.py:7`; accepts it at `sepet/api/reviews.py:21`. |
+| `seed.py` | `db` | Imports password and timestamp helpers at `sepet/api/seed.py:4`; uses them at `sepet/api/seed.py:193` and `sepet/api/seed.py:194`. |
+
+There is also an implicit data contract across modules and the schema: order status literals are duplicated independently in `main.py`, `panels.py`, `reviews.py`, frontend labels, and `schema.sql`. The divergence is covered under Risks.
+
+## 3. Request Lifecycle
+
+Unless noted, `get_db()` creates a fresh SQLite connection and `with get_db() as conn` closes it after the handler. For successful writes, the context manager commits; for exceptions, the connection closes and the transaction rolls back.
+
+| Method and endpoint | Handler-to-database path |
+| --- | --- |
+| `GET /api/restaurants` | `list_restaurants` at `sepet/api/main.py:33` -> `get_db` at `sepet/api/main.py:47` -> reads `restaurant` at line 44 and aggregates `restaurant_review` at lines 51-53 -> `displayed_rating` at `sepet/api/main.py:59` -> in-memory filters/sort at `sepet/api/main.py:63`, `sepet/api/main.py:70`. |
+| `GET /api/cuisines` | `list_cuisines` at `sepet/api/main.py:73` -> `get_db` at `sepet/api/main.py:75` -> `SELECT DISTINCT cuisine FROM restaurant` at lines 76-78. |
+| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | `get_restaurant` at `sepet/api/main.py:82` -> `get_optional_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> `get_db` -> reads `restaurant`, `menu_item`, and `restaurant_review` joined to `user` at lines 85-98 -> optional `can_review` and `has_review` queries at lines 107-115 -> `displayed_rating` at line 103. |
+| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | `get_order` at `sepet/api/main.py:119` with no authentication -> `get_db` at line 121 -> reads `order` joined to `restaurant` and `order_item` at lines 122-136 -> serializes full order at lines 137-139. |
+| `POST /api/orders` | `create_order` at `sepet/api/main.py:142` -> `require_customer` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> `get_db` at line 149 -> validates restaurant and menu items at lines 150-164 -> computes price at lines 166-174 -> conditional `UPDATE user` balance deduction at lines 181-184 -> inserts `order` at lines 189-203 -> inserts `order_item` rows at lines 205-212. |
+| `POST /api/auth/register` | `register` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:59` -> `validate_registration` at line 61 -> `get_db` at line 62 -> duplicate-email check at line 63 -> inserts `user` at lines 65-68 -> optionally inserts `restaurant` at lines 70-84 -> `issue_token` inserts `auth_token` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:50`. |
+| `POST /api/auth/login` | `login` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:89` -> `get_db` at line 91 -> reads `user` at lines 92-94 -> `verify_password` at line 95 -> `issue_token` at line 97. |
+| `GET /api/auth/me` | `me` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:101` -> `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> joins `auth_token` to `user` at `sepet/api/auth.py:10`. |
