+# Sepet Kod Denetimi
+
+Kapsam: `sepet/api` ve `sepet/web/src` kaynak dosyalari tam okundu; ayrica API semasi, seed verisi, frontend konfigurasyonu ve package lock incelendi. Bu denetim kaynak degistirmedi.
+
+## 1. Module Map
+
+| Python module | Responsibilities | Reads | Writes |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `api/db.py` | SQLite connection factory, PBKDF2 password hashing, UTC timestamp helper. No ORM and no explicit transactions beyond SQLite connection context behavior. `sepet/api/db.py:11`, `sepet/api/db.py:21`, `sepet/api/db.py:27` | None directly | None directly |
+| `api/auth.py` | Converts bearer tokens to users; enforces current-user, optional-user, customer, restaurant and courier access. `sepet/api/auth.py:6`, `sepet/api/auth.py:18`, `sepet/api/auth.py:23`, `sepet/api/auth.py:33`, `sepet/api/auth.py:39`, `sepet/api/auth.py:51` | `auth_token`, `user`; `restaurant` for restaurant dependency; `courier` for courier dependency | None |
+| `api/accounts.py` | Registration, login, `/me`, wallet top-up, token issuance. `sepet/api/accounts.py:59`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:89`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:101`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:110` | `user` | `user`, `auth_token`, `restaurant` for restaurant registration |
+| `api/main.py` | Application assembly, restaurant/cuisine discovery, restaurant detail, public order lookup, order creation. `sepet/api/main.py:13`, `sepet/api/main.py:33`, `sepet/api/main.py:73`, `sepet/api/main.py:82`, `sepet/api/main.py:119`, `sepet/api/main.py:142` | `restaurant`, `restaurant_review`, `menu_item`, `order`, `order_item`, `user` | `user`, `order`, `order_item` |
+| `api/panels.py` | Customer history, restaurant and courier operational panels, menu/courier management, delivery lifecycle, earnings. `sepet/api/panels.py:68`, `sepet/api/panels.py:84`, `sepet/api/panels.py:106`, `sepet/api/panels.py:117`, `sepet/api/panels.py:160`, `sepet/api/panels.py:190`, `sepet/api/panels.py:207`, `sepet/api/panels.py:226`, `sepet/api/panels.py:247` | `order`, `order_item`, `restaurant`, `user`, `courier`, `menu_item` | `order`, `courier`, `user`, `menu_item` |
+| `api/reviews.py` | Displayed-rating calculation and customer review creation after a confirmed order. `sepet/api/reviews.py:13`, `sepet/api/reviews.py:18` | `restaurant`, `order`, `restaurant_review` | `restaurant_review` |
+| `api/seed.py` | Destructive database initialization and demo restaurants/users/couriers. `sepet/api/seed.py:162`, `sepet/api/seed.py:193` | `restaurant`, `schema.sql` | Deletes `sepet.db`; creates rows in `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `user`, `courier` |
+
+`schema.sql` is not Python, but it defines all storage. Its creation order is `restaurant`, `user`, `auth_token`, `courier`, `restaurant_review`, `menu_item`, `order`, `order_item` at `sepet/api/schema.sql:1`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:13`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:21`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:27`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:34`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:44`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:53`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:69`.
+
+## 2. Coupling
+
+| Source module | Depends on | Coupling points |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `main.py` | `accounts` | Imports router at `sepet/api/main.py:7`; registers it at `sepet/api/main.py:15`. |
