+| `main.py` | `panels` | Imports router at `sepet/api/main.py:10`; registers it before main's dynamic order routes at `sepet/api/main.py:16`, which makes `/api/orders/history` win over `/api/orders/{order_id}`. |
+| `main.py` | `reviews` | Imports router and `displayed_rating` at `sepet/api/main.py:11`; registers router at `sepet/api/main.py:17`; computes ratings at `sepet/api/main.py:59` and `sepet/api/main.py:103`. |
