+# Sepet Kod Denetimi
+
+Kapsam: `sepet/api` ve `sepet/web/src` kaynak dosyalari tam okundu; ayrica API semasi, seed verisi, frontend konfigurasyonu ve package lock incelendi. Bu denetim kaynak degistirmedi.
+
+## 1. Module Map
+
+| Python module | Responsibilities | Reads | Writes |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `api/db.py` | SQLite connection factory, PBKDF2 password hashing, UTC timestamp helper. No ORM and no explicit transactions beyond SQLite connection context behavior. `sepet/api/db.py:11`, `sepet/api/db.py:21`, `sepet/api/db.py:27` | None directly | None directly |
+| `api/auth.py` | Converts bearer tokens to users; enforces current-user, optional-user, customer, restaurant and courier access. `sepet/api/auth.py:6`, `sepet/api/auth.py:18`, `sepet/api/auth.py:23`, `sepet/api/auth.py:33`, `sepet/api/auth.py:39`, `sepet/api/auth.py:51` | `auth_token`, `user`; `restaurant` for restaurant dependency; `courier` for courier dependency | None |
+| `api/accounts.py` | Registration, login, `/me`, wallet top-up, token issuance. `sepet/api/accounts.py:59`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:89`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:101`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:110` | `user` | `user`, `auth_token`, `restaurant` for restaurant registration |
+| `api/main.py` | Application assembly, restaurant/cuisine discovery, restaurant detail, public order lookup, order creation. `sepet/api/main.py:13`, `sepet/api/main.py:33`, `sepet/api/main.py:73`, `sepet/api/main.py:82`, `sepet/api/main.py:119`, `sepet/api/main.py:142` | `restaurant`, `restaurant_review`, `menu_item`, `order`, `order_item`, `user` | `user`, `order`, `order_item` |
+| `api/panels.py` | Customer history, restaurant and courier operational panels, menu/courier management, delivery lifecycle, earnings. `sepet/api/panels.py:68`, `sepet/api/panels.py:84`, `sepet/api/panels.py:106`, `sepet/api/panels.py:117`, `sepet/api/panels.py:160`, `sepet/api/panels.py:190`, `sepet/api/panels.py:207`, `sepet/api/panels.py:226`, `sepet/api/panels.py:247` | `order`, `order_item`, `restaurant`, `user`, `courier`, `menu_item` | `order`, `courier`, `user`, `menu_item` |
+| `api/reviews.py` | Displayed-rating calculation and customer review creation after a confirmed order. `sepet/api/reviews.py:13`, `sepet/api/reviews.py:18` | `restaurant`, `order`, `restaurant_review` | `restaurant_review` |
+| `api/seed.py` | Destructive database initialization and demo restaurants/users/couriers. `sepet/api/seed.py:162`, `sepet/api/seed.py:193` | `restaurant`, `schema.sql` | Deletes `sepet.db`; creates rows in `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `user`, `courier` |
+
+`schema.sql` is not Python, but it defines all storage. Its creation order is `restaurant`, `user`, `auth_token`, `courier`, `restaurant_review`, `menu_item`, `order`, `order_item` at `sepet/api/schema.sql:1`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:13`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:21`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:27`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:34`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:44`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:53`, `sepet/api/schema.sql:69`.
+
+## 2. Coupling
+
+| Source module | Depends on | Coupling points |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `main.py` | `accounts` | Imports router at `sepet/api/main.py:7`; registers it at `sepet/api/main.py:15`. |
+| `main.py` | `auth` | Imports optional/customer dependencies at `sepet/api/main.py:8`; uses them at `sepet/api/main.py:83` and `sepet/api/main.py:143`. |
+| `main.py` | `db` | Imports `get_db` at `sepet/api/main.py:9`; opens connections at `sepet/api/main.py:47`, `sepet/api/main.py:75`, `sepet/api/main.py:84`, `sepet/api/main.py:121`, `sepet/api/main.py:149`. |
+| `main.py` | `panels` | Imports router at `sepet/api/main.py:10`; registers it before main's dynamic order routes at `sepet/api/main.py:16`, which makes `/api/orders/history` win over `/api/orders/{order_id}`. |
+| `main.py` | `reviews` | Imports router and `displayed_rating` at `sepet/api/main.py:11`; registers router at `sepet/api/main.py:17`; computes ratings at `sepet/api/main.py:59` and `sepet/api/main.py:103`. |
+| `accounts.py` | `auth` | Imports `get_current_user` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:7`; protects `/me` and top-up at `sepet/api/accounts.py:102` and `sepet/api/accounts.py:111`. |
+| `accounts.py` | `db` | Imports helpers at `sepet/api/accounts.py:8`; opens transactions at `sepet/api/accounts.py:62`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:91`, `sepet/api/accounts.py:115`. |
+| `auth.py` | `db` | Imports `get_db` at `sepet/api/auth.py:3`; reads token users at `sepet/api/auth.py:19`; reads restaurant/courier profiles at `sepet/api/auth.py:42` and `sepet/api/auth.py:54`. |
+| `panels.py` | `auth` | Imports role dependencies at `sepet/api/panels.py:6`; uses them at `sepet/api/panels.py:69`, `sepet/api/panels.py:87`, `sepet/api/panels.py:107`, `sepet/api/panels.py:118`, `sepet/api/panels.py:129`, `sepet/api/panels.py:149`, `sepet/api/panels.py:164`, `sepet/api/panels.py:191`, `sepet/api/panels.py:208`, `sepet/api/panels.py:227`, `sepet/api/panels.py:248`. |
+| `panels.py` | `db` | Imports `get_db` at `sepet/api/panels.py:7`; opens direct database transactions at `sepet/api/panels.py:70`, `sepet/api/panels.py:101`, `sepet/api/panels.py:109`, `sepet/api/panels.py:120`, `sepet/api/panels.py:133`, `sepet/api/panels.py:151`, `sepet/api/panels.py:168`, `sepet/api/panels.py:193`, `sepet/api/panels.py:211`, `sepet/api/panels.py:229`, `sepet/api/panels.py:250`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `auth` | Imports dependencies at `sepet/api/reviews.py:5`; uses `require_customer` at `sepet/api/reviews.py:22`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `db` | Imports helpers at `sepet/api/reviews.py:6`; opens a transaction at `sepet/api/reviews.py:26`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `panels` | Imports `ReviewInput` from the panels module at `sepet/api/reviews.py:7`; accepts it at `sepet/api/reviews.py:21`. |
+| `seed.py` | `db` | Imports password and timestamp helpers at `sepet/api/seed.py:4`; uses them at `sepet/api/seed.py:193` and `sepet/api/seed.py:194`. |
+
+There is also an implicit data contract across modules and the schema: order status literals are duplicated independently in `main.py`, `panels.py`, `reviews.py`, frontend labels, and `schema.sql`. The divergence is covered under Risks.
+
+## 3. Request Lifecycle
+
+Unless noted, `get_db()` creates a fresh SQLite connection and `with get_db() as conn` closes it after the handler. For successful writes, the context manager commits; for exceptions, the connection closes and the transaction rolls back.
+
+| Method and endpoint | Handler-to-database path |
+| --- | --- |
+| `GET /api/restaurants` | `list_restaurants` at `sepet/api/main.py:33` -> `get_db` at `sepet/api/main.py:47` -> reads `restaurant` at line 44 and aggregates `restaurant_review` at lines 51-53 -> `displayed_rating` at `sepet/api/main.py:59` -> in-memory filters/sort at `sepet/api/main.py:63`, `sepet/api/main.py:70`. |
+| `GET /api/cuisines` | `list_cuisines` at `sepet/api/main.py:73` -> `get_db` at `sepet/api/main.py:75` -> `SELECT DISTINCT cuisine FROM restaurant` at lines 76-78. |
+| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | `get_restaurant` at `sepet/api/main.py:82` -> `get_optional_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> `get_db` -> reads `restaurant`, `menu_item`, and `restaurant_review` joined to `user` at lines 85-98 -> optional `can_review` and `has_review` queries at lines 107-115 -> `displayed_rating` at line 103. |
+| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | `get_order` at `sepet/api/main.py:119` with no authentication -> `get_db` at line 121 -> reads `order` joined to `restaurant` and `order_item` at lines 122-136 -> serializes full order at lines 137-139. |
+| `POST /api/orders` | `create_order` at `sepet/api/main.py:142` -> `require_customer` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> `get_db` at line 149 -> validates restaurant and menu items at lines 150-164 -> computes price at lines 166-174 -> conditional `UPDATE user` balance deduction at lines 181-184 -> inserts `order` at lines 189-203 -> inserts `order_item` rows at lines 205-212. |
+| `POST /api/auth/register` | `register` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:59` -> `validate_registration` at line 61 -> `get_db` at line 62 -> duplicate-email check at line 63 -> inserts `user` at lines 65-68 -> optionally inserts `restaurant` at lines 70-84 -> `issue_token` inserts `auth_token` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:50`. |
+| `POST /api/auth/login` | `login` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:89` -> `get_db` at line 91 -> reads `user` at lines 92-94 -> `verify_password` at line 95 -> `issue_token` at line 97. |
+| `GET /api/auth/me` | `me` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:101` -> `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> joins `auth_token` to `user` at `sepet/api/auth.py:10`. |
+| `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` | `top_up_wallet` at `sepet/api/accounts.py:110` -> role check at line 112 -> `get_current_user` -> `get_db` at line 115 -> `UPDATE user` at lines 116-119 -> reselects balance at line 122. |
+| `GET /api/orders/history` | `order_history` at `sepet/api/panels.py:68` -> `require_customer` -> `get_db` at line 70 -> reads customer orders at lines 71-80 -> `serialize_orders` at line 81 reads each order's `order_item` rows at `sepet/api/panels.py:39`. |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/orders` | `restaurant_orders` at `sepet/api/panels.py:84` -> `require_restaurant` reads `restaurant` by `user_id` at `sepet/api/auth.py:42` -> `get_db` at `sepet/api/panels.py:101` -> reads orders for that restaurant at lines 90-102 -> `serialize_orders` at line 103. |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/couriers` | `list_couriers` at `sepet/api/panels.py:106` -> `require_restaurant` -> `get_db` at line 109 -> reads own `courier` rows at lines 110-113. |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/menu-items` | `list_menu_items` at `sepet/api/panels.py:117` -> `require_restaurant` -> `get_db` at line 120 -> reads own `menu_item` rows at lines 121-124. |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` | `create_courier` at `sepet/api/panels.py:128` -> `require_restaurant` -> `get_db` at line 133 -> checks duplicate `user` email at line 134 -> inserts `user` at lines 136-139 -> inserts `courier` at lines 141-144. |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/menu-items` | `add_menu_item` at `sepet/api/panels.py:148` -> `require_restaurant` -> `get_db` at line 151 -> inserts own `menu_item` at lines 152-156. |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/orders/{order_id}/assign-courier` | `assign_courier` at `sepet/api/panels.py:160` -> `require_restaurant` -> `get_db` at line 168 -> reads order and checks ownership/status at lines 169-175 -> reads own courier at lines 176-181 -> updates `order.courier_id`, `courier_assigned_at`, `status` at lines 182-186. |
+| `GET /api/courier/orders` | `courier_orders` at `sepet/api/panels.py:190` -> `require_courier` reads `courier` at `sepet/api/auth.py:54` -> `get_db` at `sepet/api/panels.py:193` -> reads orders assigned to the courier at lines 194-203 -> `serialize_orders` at line 204. |
